        └──────┬───────┘
               ↓
       ┌───────┴────────┐
       ↓                ↓
    SQLite          PostgreSQL
```

ORM tumhare Python models ko appropriate SQL mein translate karne mein help karta hai.

**BUT ek important catch:** sirf URL change **har situation mein 100% enough nahi hota**. Different databases ke features/types/dialects alag ho sakte hain, aur connection driver bhi install karna padta hai.

For example PostgreSQL ke liye usually driver chahiye:

```bash
pipenv install psycopg
```

So exam/interview ke liye line yaad rakho:

> **ORM database-specific SQL ko abstract karta hai, so application/model code ko largely same rakhkar database change karna easier ho jata hai; mainly engine/connection configuration change hoti hai.**
